    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290055</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>３種の薬草を渡しますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Give them the three herbs?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほーら、来たー。
やーっぱり、こいつら、
また来たな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heeey, they're heeere.
Of cooourse they'd
come back again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いんやー、物欲の塊、
こりゃまた、ひどいもんだすなー。
濡れ手に粟を目論むダメ人間だす</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No waaay, it's yew big lumps of want, want, want.
We're in for another disaster, huh. Yew worthless
humans think yew can get somethin' for nothin'.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここまで来ると
逆に清々しいぐらい
本性丸出しになったね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y'know, after all this, seeing their
real feelings on naked display
is surprisingly refreshing.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くせぇこと言ってんなよ。
魅惑のありじごくコーナーの
虜になったんだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Cut the tough act. Aren't ya
all just prisoners of the
Antlion Corner's allure?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなアホ面どもに、
悲しいお知らせだす</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We've got something real
sad to tell ye stupid mugs.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今回を持って、
ありじごくコーナーは、
終わりになるだすよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>After this next round,
the Antlion Corner
will be closing~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これで、終わりって言われても
今まで一度も、まともな
交換してもらってないんだけド……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, even if you're closing after this,
it's not like you ever, even one single
time, gave us a fair exchange, sooo...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クッルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Colleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんな野暮な事は言いっこナシだぜ。
最後の最後だからこそ……、
な？　わかるだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's drop the unsophisticated
talk, a'ight? This is the very, very
end, so... You get me, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そゆことで、
こちらが頂戴する
最後の交換品のお知らせ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, that said, allow me to announce:
this time, the very last "trade"
we'll be taking off you is...~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………、
今、ハッキリと、
頂戴するって言いやがったぞ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...They just clearly
friggin' said they're
just taking our stuff...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286120</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ざざーん！
薬草のレッドシリーズ
3種類どぇーす</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ta-dah! It's three
Red Series herbs!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>レッドシリーズの
3種類って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Three Red Series herbs"...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>物知らずなカマトトだすなー。
いいだすか？　よっく聞くだすよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Playing all dumb, are
yew? Alright, listen up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>レッドセージ、
レッドベルベーヌ
レッドバジルのみっつだすよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Red Sage, Red
Verbena, and Red
Basil. Those three.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さぁ、出すのか？
出さないのか？
どっちなんだい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, will you?
Won't you?
Tell us already!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うひょー、ほんとにくれやがった！
こんな貴重なもんくれやがったー！
それなら、早速行ってみるか。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yahoo, they really gave'em to us! So
valuable, and they gave'em right to us!
Alright, then, let's just hurry up and do this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だべよ？　だべか？
そうだべか？？？
ごって、わくわく～～～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is it? Isn't it? It is, isn't it?
Aaalrighty, so exciting~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>手に入れるの大変だったのに……。
ポーイッて捨てられてるように
見えるの悲しいね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those were so hard to get,
so...seeing them get thrown
away like that is so sad...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>捨ててねぇって毎回言ってんだろ！
グダグダ言ってねぇで、
黙って見てろや！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've told ya we're not throwin' 'em away
every single time, haven't I!? Just
shut the hell up already and watch!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほい、ほい、行く出すよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yas, yas, let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マジで？　ジーマー？
本気の本気で？？？
ガス、ガスガス、ガス！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really? For realsies?
Truthfully truly?? Vroom,
vroom vroom, vroom!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい、ただいま、
私の手元に届きました～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, yes, just now, I have received
it with these very hands.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さてさて、
今回のお宝は～？？
なんだすか～～～？？？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's see, what treasure's
it this time~? Whatizzit~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だかだかだかだかだか～
ざざ～～～～ん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dundundundun
dun~ Ta-dah!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今回はお手紙でした！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This time, it's a letter!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>手紙、です……、か？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A...letter?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それでは、早速
読んでみましょう
え～なになに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well then, let's
get right to reading
it. Okay, let's see here...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>前略
いつもいつも
アイテムありがちょ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To keep it brief,
thankies thankies
for all the items!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おかげで、ウマウマで、
パンパン∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thanks to your yummies, there's
no more rumbly in my tumbly!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなユーに、
称号あげちゃうお☆</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so, I'll give
you a title!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぜひ、この称号で世界を
旅してね◎　ほんと
美味しかったにょ～～～～∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please travel the world
with this title! Those items
were so so delicious!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えー、以上です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aaand that's all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>5</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おい、最後美味しかったって……
今までの全部食ってるだか？
剣やら指輪やら、ぜーんぶ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, so ya finished with "delicious"...
Are you sayin' they ate everything up
'til now? The sword, the ring, everything?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうなんだすかねぇ。
うちらも、知らんだすから。
ぶひゃひゃひゃひゃひゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder that, too. But
we don't know, yew know?
Gyahyahyahyahya...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288076</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んで、肝心のご褒美は
称号って書いてあったな。
はい、どんぞ～～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, the real point, the reward,
they said it's a title, right. So
here ya go, take it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288252</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……、一応聞くけどよ、
『うに』ってどういう意味だ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I don't really know what kinda
answer I'm hoping for, but what
do you mean by "ow"...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>う～～～～ん、
察するにうしにんの略称で
『うに』なんじゃね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmmmmmmmmmmm... Just a
guess, but maybe it's short for
Kowz? Just take off two letters. "ow."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>君もボクらの仲間入り！
って感じで∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So now you and me can
be friends! So amazing!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おめでとう。
これで、このコーナーも終了！
今までありがと、さよなら～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Congratulations. With this,
our Corner is done! Thank
you for everything! Farewell~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>って、おい！
騙されねぇぞ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, wait! You
can't fool me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うげっ！
ヤツらもういないだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh! They're
already gone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>逃げ足の早い事だなや。
んで、ハゲぼうずどうするだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They were pretty quick at the runnin',
at least. So, what'll we do, numbskull?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうもこうも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is B.S...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっと&lt;Dio&gt;！
何してるの？
やめなってば</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, &lt;Dio&gt;! What
are you doing?
C'mon, cut it out!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヤツら……、ここに……、
いろんなもん入れてるだろ？
だから、なんか、あるんじゃ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those jerks...put all that
stuff...in here, didn't they?
So, there must be something...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんか、いっぱい出てきたぞ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa, this's a whole lotta something!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんなにいっぱい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's so much...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたもんかね。
もらっちゃっていいのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So what'll we do?
Should we just take it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;たん、ケツの穴が小さいど。
ヤツらが搾取したもんだーよ。
こっちも貰う権利があるだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You don't got to be anal about it, &lt;Rody&gt;.
They milked us dry, real thoroughly.
If'n we take a little back, it's only fair!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう、
この中に捨ててあるものを、
うちらが拾ったってだけ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, exactly. And we're
only picking up the stuff
they threw away, anyway.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んだんだ。捨てる神ありゃ
拾う神ありって事だーよ。
つまり、おらが神様って事だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And if there's a god of throwin' stuff
away, there's a god of pickin' it up.
Which makes me God, see?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>might need to be changed but i'm done for tonight i'm done i'm done i'mo edano</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はいはい～。
お帰りはあちら～。
まったねぇ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, yes~ You
can go back that
way~ See you soon~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
